# Content scripts

## Load order (manifest)

Per platform: `humanise.js` → `file-upload.js` → platform script → `detector.js` (Greenhouse/Workday/LinkedIn/Indeed vary — see `manifest.json`).

## Modules

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `detector.js` | Platform detect, `JOB_DETECTED`, route `FILL_FORM` / `SCRAPE_JOB` |
| `humanise.js` | `window.blitzHumanise` — typing, clicks, native value setter for React |
| `file-upload.js` | Attach PDF/base64 to file inputs |
| `greenhouse.js` / `linkedin.js` / `indeed.js` / `workday.js` | `scrapeJob()`, `fillForm(payload)` on `window.blitz*` |

## Fill payload

`{ tailoredCV, coverLetter, screeningAnswers, userProfile, pdfBase64?, autoSubmit? }`

## Platform notes

- **LinkedIn**: multi-step Easy Apply modal; click Apply on fill; optional `autoSubmit`
- **Indeed**: block `externalApply` redirects
- **Workday**: `queryDeep()` for Shadow DOM
- **Greenhouse**: `DataTransfer` for resume upload

## Do not

- Call AI APIs from content scripts
- Auto-fill without `FILL_FORM` message (detect/scrape only on page load)
